    "A bigger countdown that shifts from green to red.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una cuenta regresiva más grande que pasa de verde a rojo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A meal period is required, but you and your manager can agree to skip it since your shift is 6 hours or less.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se requiere un período de comida, pero tú y tu gerente pueden acordar omitirlo porque tu turno es de 6 horas o menos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new ring design for the Home Screen and Lock Screen that shifts from green to red as your break gets close.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un nuevo diseño de anillo para la pantalla de inicio y la pantalla de bloqueo que cambia de verde a rojo a medida que se acerca tu descanso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
