    "This electronic discount card is for the sole use of the Whole Foods Market Team Member named above. Additional picture identification may be requested. Misuse of the discount card, including electronic duplication, is strictly prohibited. This card is the sole property of Whole Foods Market and use of it is governed by the discount policy in the GIG.": {
